{
  "_about": "Golden questions for the sample production with 'today' = 2026-11-24. Each 'expect' entry is a group of acceptable phrasings (case-insensitive); every group must appear in the answer. 'cite_any': at least one of these source ids must be cited and verified. 'abstain': the right answer is that the data doesn't say.",
